          "id": "step-2-1",
          "step": "2.1",
          "claim": "Substituting $j=0$ and $T^\\varphi=0$ into the system of [F1] leaves exactly $G_{ab}+\\Lambda g_{ab}=\\kappa T^{\\mathrm{EM}}_{ab}$, $dF=0$, and $\\nabla_aF^{ab}=0$. Conversely, an exact-potential source-free solution with $\\varphi=\\pi=0$ satisfies each charged-scalar equation by step 1.1 and each remaining equation by its source-free hypothesis.",
          "inputs": [
