          "step": "3.1",
          "claim": "For exact-potential electrovacuum initial data, setting $\\varphi_0=0$, $\\pi_n=0$, and hence $\\pi_i=0$ makes $j=0$ and $T^\\varphi=0$ on the initial slice. The sourced Maxwell and total-stress Einstein constraints in [L1] then reduce to the source-free electrovacuum constraints. Applying [L1] conditionally under [A2] gives a smooth local solution, and step 2.1 identifies it with this zero-scalar branch. No global existence claim follows.",
